WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
It was late at night.

2
00:00:04.001 --> 00:00:06.189
Kip was wide-awake.

3
00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.943
Kip looked at his books.

4
00:00:08.944 --> 00:00:14.309
"I have so many books," said Kip.

5
00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:27.840
"I'll stay up and read all night."

6
00:00:27.841 --> 00:00:40.294
Kip made some popcorn.

7
00:00:40.295 --> 00:00:50.613
He took a book off the shelf.

8
00:00:50.614 --> 00:00:53.567
He sat down in his cozy chair.

9
00:00:53.568 --> 00:00:58.068
"I have everything I need," said Kip.

10
00:00:58.069 --> 00:01:04.230
"I have a good book and some popcorn.

11
00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:10.723
I just wish Bird was here."

12
00:01:10.724 --> 00:01:13.953
Kip peeked out his hole.

13
00:01:13.954 --> 00:01:16.975
He looked down at Bird.

14
00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:20.904
"She's sleeping," said Kip.

15
00:01:20.905 --> 00:01:24.638
"I shouldn't wake her up."

16
00:01:24.639 --> 00:01:33.001
Kip went back to his cozy chair.

17
00:01:33.002 --> 00:01:38.774
He ate some popcorn.

18
00:01:38.775 --> 00:01:40.661
He opened his book.

19
00:01:40.662 --> 00:01:44.459
Kip started to read.

20
00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:47.508
It was a very scary book.

21
00:01:47.509 --> 00:01:56.829
It was about a spooky ghost.

22
00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.036
"Ah!" cried Kip.

23
00:01:59.037 --> 00:02:06.324
Popcorn went everywhere.

24
00:02:06.325 --> 00:02:12.403
And Bird woke up!

